“(d) Grants for Economic Adjustment.—There are authorized to be appropriated to carry out section 209 (other than subsections (d) and (e)), to remain available until expended—“(1) $65,000,000 for fiscal year 2025;
“(2) $75,000,000 for fiscal year 2026;
