“(i) Critical Supply Chain Site Development Grant Program.—There is authorized to be appropriated to carry out section 222 $20,000,000 for each of fiscal years 2025 through 2029, to remain available until expended.138 STAT. 3201
“(j) Technical Assistance Liaisons.—There is authorized to be appropriated to carry out section 510 $5,000,000 for each of fiscal years 2025 through 2029, to remain available until expended.”
